        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Custer_Monument_on_Last_Stand_Hill_After_its_Completion_(1f50cb51d68b4015a1a61c673c88179b).tif"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
